     character before the key symbol if the ALT key is pressed simultaneously,
     use wwssccoonnssccttll kkeeyybbooaarrdd..eennccooddiinngg==ddee..nnooddeeaadd..mmeettaaeesscc.  To set it at kernel
     build time, add the following to the kernel configuration file:

           option PCKBD_LAYOUT="(KB_DE|KB_NODEAD|KB_METAESC)"

